    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Town_08Gro_01:FEV_Town_08Gro_01_027:1d294d61",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_FEV_Town_08Gro_01",
        "key": "FEV_Town_08Gro_01_027",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Town_08Gro_01:FEV_Town_08Gro_01_027:1d294d61",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Town_08Gro_01:FEV_Town_08Gro_01_027:1d294d61",
        "jp_sha256": "256c3c745c7f4d26a70a3854c3c48cfc4abac20bedb98b1f1b6860dba6c5cf9f",
        "official_en_sha256": "bcf3d8548a139035fa2c093bad7928097289876ea7178d0344ccc987c6be5053"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "このガベラダで見聞きしたことは\r\n外の大陸には漏らさんでくれよ。\r\nここの技術は戦の元になりかねないからな。",
        "official_en": "Fair warning, friend: I’d refrain from sharing anything you see or hear in Gaberada. The technology here alone could be enough to trigger a war.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
      },
