        "official_en_sha256": "f54acd0486bd346a4997bebb7f6bf43c42fd22db0706d4162ffc65d7a084708a"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "この大陸の瘴気すべてを\r\nきれいにするには、あと何百年かかるのか……。",
        "official_en": "I often wonder how many centuries we must toil to cleanse our continent of the miasma.",
        "real_en": null
      },
