        "jp_sha256": "af4ca7c071c66f4d15bf95d485aad85ed7ab10921c347db816b82f917d2f3373",
        "official_en_sha256": "a82c48acfb3544defc320b3368975ba519a05a43fd7ae2fb0d4988b740850ec2"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "しかも飛空艇から直接取引できるという話だ。\r\n君たちも飛空艇に乗るなら、海上にいる船は要チェックだな。",
        "official_en": "It’s rumored that they cater to airship travelers. So if you’re flying above the seas, one of the ships you spot might belong to them.",
        "real_en": "They say you can trade with it directly from your airship. If you're flying over the sea, keep an eye out for ships below."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
