        "official_en_sha256": "8cc5289321400a023883cb12a6220f6ae2f2d2d8e8ea535610791650c4efc7c2"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "だから、この先のダグルにまで\r\n出稼ぎにいく奴も多い。\r\nあの町には神殿の管理の仕事があるからな。",
        "official_en": "A lotta folks even go as far as Duggle in search of work. They’re always looking for people to take care of the shrines there.",
        "real_en": "That's why so many people go all the way to Duggle for work. There are jobs maintaining the temple there."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
