        "official_en_sha256": "b0f79fc02cd4a505ed143c174fc3377769d20fb71f7b3e82441312d1bd33bd3e"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "もうあげるものはないぜ。\r\n俺はここに居続けるけどな。",
        "official_en": "I’ve got nothing else to give you. Now if you’ll excuse me, I’m trying very hard not to be noticed.",
        "real_en": "I don't have anything else to give you. But I'll be staying right here."
