        "official_en_sha256": "2c9f0f1bea5d6c08e97258318c9c980fe161a619c43708eb2f203f2dd14cb8d0"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ヘスの技術を使って……\r\n古代魔法の爆弾をつくり……瘴気を一掃する……\r\nいや……だがそれでは過去の二の舞か……",
        "official_en": "Perhaps we could use Hessian technology—create a bomb with a warhead containing ancient magic to blow away the miasma. No, no...that would be repeating the atrocities of the past.",
        "real_en": "Use Hessian technology... make a bomb with ancient magic to clear away the miasma... No... Wouldn't that just repeat the past...?"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
