        "official_en_sha256": "14274f3a544f59fd5490c85a0ee9c75011be90feddbdbb3319446a0b5b244b74"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "各地で破壊されたクリスタル……\r\nその中から観測された高エネルギー反応……\r\nこれは……心臓……？　幻獣……？",
        "official_en": "Those high energy readings from the destroyed Crystals came from...a heart? And...an esper?",
        "real_en": "The Crystals destroyed around the world... The high-energy reactions detected within them... Is that... a heart...? An Eidolon...?"
