        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Town_08Gro_01:FEV_Town_08Gro_01_021:4fb53468",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Town_08Gro_01:FEV_Town_08Gro_01_021:4fb53468",
        "jp_sha256": "df4507cdbcb82c608d84869858c7d5f48ac64985a6472bba6e889eb2c5a0c2c6",
        "official_en_sha256": "1561a71cb75f3edf51cc1cf83a708a1f25205875b62ee7c7bf934216b366892c"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "我々が……やり遂げるしかないのだ。\r\n困難を悟りながら、この大陸に移り住んだ\r\n先人たちの意思を継いでな……",
        "official_en": "As many as it takes. Whether it be centuries, or even millennia. We <text style=\"italic\">must</> carry on the will of our ancestors who migrated to this continent.",
        "real_en": "We have to see it through... We must carry on the will of the ancestors who moved here knowing how difficult it would be..."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
